cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use cld-reducer, please cite the foundational 2012 paper that
  introduced the assignment-minimum clique covering problem (Ennis, Fayle, &
  Ennis 2012). You may also reference the Sensometrics 2026 talk that presents
  this MILP-based implementation.
